# 🔌 Hardware

This folder contains all hardware-related files for the IoT predictive maintenance system.

## 📂 Subfolders

### circuit_diagrams/
- Schematic designs
- PCB layouts
- Pin connection diagrams
- Eagle/KiCAD files

### sensor_specifications/
- ADXL335 accelerometer datasheet
- DS18B20 temperature sensor datasheet
- Technical specifications
- Calibration procedures

## 📋 Files

- **components_list.md** - Complete bill of materials (BOM)
- **pinout_diagram.md** - ESP32 pin configuration
- **assembly_guide.md** - Hardware assembly instructions

---

**Note:** Add your circuit diagrams, datasheets, and schematics here.
